+	//      sensor clip, white balance, CDL and ODT: a minimap is data.
+	//      The cvar is written on the main thread and read here on the render thread, so the gate
+	//      is coarse by one or two frames around the bake - which is harmless, because the bake is
+	//      a modal operation and the frames it brackets are thrown away.
